%% Supply Commitment sequence through actual route/controller/service layers
sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator as KDKMP Operator
    actor Manager as KDKMP Manager
    participant UI as React/Inertia UI
    participant Route as routes/web.php + auth/role middleware
    participant C as CommitmentController / CommitmentVersionController
    participant A as CommitmentApprovalController
    participant Policy as Policies
    participant S as CommitmentWorkflowService
    participant Metrics as SupplyMetricsService
    participant Support as AuditService / OperationalNotificationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL via Eloquent

    Operator->>UI: Fill Commitment draft form
    UI->>Route: POST /kdkmp/commitments
    Route->>C: store()
    C->>Policy: authorize organization/role/resource
    Policy-->>C: allowed
    C->>S: createDraft business command
    S->>DB: BEGIN; lock/validate required records
    S->>DB: INSERT supply_commitments
    S->>DB: INSERT commitment_versions (DRAFT)
    S->>Support: record audit
    S->>DB: COMMIT
    S-->>C: draft commitment + version
    C-->>UI: Inertia redirect / response

    Operator->>UI: Submit DRAFT version
    UI->>Route: POST /kdkmp/commitments/{commitment}/versions/{version}/submit
    Route->>C: CommitmentVersionController::submit()
    C->>Policy: authorize maker + organization
    C->>S: submit version command
    S->>DB: transaction + row locks + revalidation
    S->>DB: UPDATE version -> PENDING_APPROVAL
    S->>Support: audit + manager notification
    S-->>UI: submitted

    Manager->>UI: Open approval queue
    UI->>Route: POST /kdkmp/manager/approvals/{commitment}/versions/{version}/approve
    Route->>A: approve()
    A->>Policy: authorize manager + same organization
    A->>S: approve version command
    S->>DB: transaction + row locks
    S->>S: enforce maker-checker and current-version rules
    S->>DB: UPDATE version -> APPROVED
    S->>DB: UPDATE commitment active_version_id / confidence state
    S->>Support: audit + operator notification
    S-->>A: approved commitment
    A-->>UI: redirect / review result

    UI->>Route: GET commitment / forecast / dashboard read surface
    Route->>C: index() / show() read request
    C->>Metrics: calculate derived supply metrics
    Metrics->>DB: read Forecast + valid commitments + accepted fallback allocations
    Metrics->>Metrics: derive Direct Safe / At-Risk / Coverage / Shortfall
    Metrics-->>C: read-only derived result
    C-->>UI: Inertia props with derived metrics
